sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as React Dashboard
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant INV as Inventory Service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant NOTIF as Notification Service
  UI->>GW: POST /api/inventory/{id}/adjust
  GW->>INV: Forward with identity headers
  INV->>INV: Persist stock movement
  INV->>MQ: Publish inventory.low_stock_detected
  MQ->>NOTIF: Consume event
  NOTIF->>NOTIF: Persist alert and send email

